# Step 28, its third pull request's first part: custom commands, the agent
# loop's side. A prompt that came from a command carries it wherever the
# loop takes the prompt (delivered at a boundary, a turn of its own, queued,
# held), and its user message records it: each path, broken one at a time,
# with the test that must fail.

[break] a-delivered-steering-message-forgets-its-command
rule: A command's steering message delivered at a boundary records the command it came from.
file: crates/cineris-agent/src/turn.rs
in: Session::deliver_steer
find: delivery: steer, command
replace: delivery: steer, command: None
caught-by:
    cineris-agent::it steering::a_steering_message_is_delivered_after_the_round_and_before_the_next_request

[break] a-steering-message-that-becomes-a-turn-forgets-its-command
rule: A command's steering message that finds no boundary is the next turn's prompt, with the command it came from.
file: crates/cineris-agent/src/turn.rs
in: Session::next_turn
find: verify: false, ticket, command
replace: verify: false, ticket, command: None
caught-by:
    cineris-agent::it steering::a_steering_message_that_finds_no_boundary_becomes_the_next_turn

[break] a-held-steering-message-forgets-its-command
rule: A command's steering message held behind a turn that did not complete is delivered as its own turn, with the command it came from.
file: crates/cineris-agent/src/turn.rs
in: Session::hold
find: verify: false, ticket, command
replace: verify: false, ticket, command: None
caught-by:
    cineris-agent::it steering::a_steering_message_left_behind_by_a_failed_turn_is_held_with_the_queue

[break] a-queued-prompt-forgets-its-command
rule: A command's prompt queued behind a running turn starts its turn with the command it came from.
file: crates/cineris-agent/src/session.rs
in: SessionHandle::prompt_from
find:
    delivery: Some(Delivery::Queue),
    compact: None,
    verify: false,
    ticket,
    command
replace:
    delivery: Some(Delivery::Queue),
    compact: None,
    verify: false,
    ticket,
    command: None
caught-by:
    cineris-agent::it steering::queued_prompts_run_one_at_a_time_after_a_turn_that_completed
